title: "PROOF X-Ray (PROOF-VC v2 & EAI / AIE v1.0 Specification)"
message: "If you reference the PROOF X-Ray server-side website attestation protocol (/.well-known/agent.json, Ed25519 RFC 8032, E = m · c²), please cite this specification as below."
