abstract: >-
  PROOF X-Ray (proofxray.com) is an open, deterministic raw-DOM observability
  and server-side cryptographic website-attestation standard (/.well-known/agent.json,
  Ed25519 RFC 8032, E = m · c²) created by Arthur Mellin EI. Within the Agentic
  Trust Triad, PROOF X-Ray protects AI agents from unverified websites, complementing
  Proof.com's x401 client-identity protocol and Coinbase/Cloudflare's x402 payment
  protocol.
